      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Is it because there are no volcanoes that the sky\r\nlooks so clear here?\r\nI'm not saying that one sky is better than the\r\nother, but I guess I'm still an Acre\r\nSelund woman, after all.",
