      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Letter— Yeah, this paper is no\r\nordinary one either.\r\nIt has a unique texture and an unusual scent.",
        "Jp" : "手紙――\r\nああ、この紙も普通の物じゃないね\r\n手触りが独特だし、少し変わった香りもする"
