      "GmdIndex" : 6,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "—the paper, the words, the lettering design...\r\nIt must have been hard to get all this together!",
        "Jp" : "――紙も、言葉も、文字のデザインも\r\nこれだけ揃えるのは大変だったろう"
