      "GmdIndex" : 9,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "That's right— \r\nHow about coming over for tea next time? \r\nI've finally managed to make a certain type of \r\nbaked confectionery that looks the part. \r\nI really want to hear your thoughts on it, \r\nso please come and try it.",
